## Layout

| Folder | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `data/raw/` | Original data, never modified (git-ignored) |
| `data/processed/` | Outputs of `scripts/` (git-ignored, regenerable) |
| `scripts/` | Reproducible pipeline steps |
| `notebooks/` | Exploration |
| `reports/` | Quarto report (HTML and Word) |
| `figures/` | Figures saved by scripts |

## Usage

```powershell
uv sync
uv run python scripts/prepare_data.py
uv run quarto render reports/report.qmd
```

For notebooks in VS Code, pick the interpreter in `.venv`.
